{
 "schema": 1,
 "id": "skin-colour",
 "title": {
  "zh": "写实皮肤的颜色：光谱模型 vs NIST 皮肤反射光谱和部位色度",
  "en": "Lifelike skin colour: the spectral model vs NIST skin reflectance and regional colorimetry"
 },
 "method": {
  "zh": "前 100 行：两层皮肤光谱模型（tools/look/skin_colour.py）对 NIST 人体皮肤反射参考数据逐人拟合（每人只拟合黑色素和真皮血量），模型反射率与实测反射率换成 D65、CIE 1931 2° 下的 CIELAB 后的色差 ΔE00；同列给出 400–700 nm 的光谱 RMS、查表后的色差和同一人三次扫描之间的色差（测量本身的噪声）。其后几行：把文献里\"该部位 − 参照部位\"的 CIELAB 差加到 NIST 中位数的颜色上，用同一模型反推黑色素和血量倍数后剩下的色差；手掌一行是查找表给出的手掌颜色的 L*。数据来自 data/curated/look/skin-colour.json。",
  "en": "The first 100 rows: the two-layer spectral skin model (tools/look/skin_colour.py) fitted to each subject of the NIST reference data set of human skin reflectance (only melanin and dermal blood per subject); the colour difference ΔE00 between model and measured reflectance as CIELAB under D65 and CIE 1931 2°. Alongside: the spectral RMS over 400–700 nm, the difference through the lookup table, and the difference between the subject's own three scans (the noise of the measurement). The rows after that: the published CIELAB difference \"site − reference site\" added to the colour of the NIST median and inverted with the same model into melanin and blood multipliers, and the colour difference left over; the palm row is L* of the palm colour from the lookup table. Data from data/curated/look/skin-colour.json."
 },
 "tolerance": {
  "zh": "ΔE00 ≤ 3 记 within（约为同一人重复测量差的最大值，见 repeatScanDE2000）；手掌按文献的 1 SD（4.6 L*）。",
  "en": "ΔE00 ≤ 3 counts as within (about the largest difference between one subject's repeated scans, see repeatScanDE2000); the palm uses the paper's 1 SD (4.6 L*)."
 },
