 "notes": [
  {
   "zh": "NIST 只测了前臂内侧，100 人里没有 ITA° < −30 的；深肤色一端和身体其他部位都靠模型外推或文献的部位差。",
   "en": "NIST measured only the inner forearm, and none of its 100 subjects has ITA° < −30; the deep end and every other body site rely on extrapolation by the model or on published site differences."
  },
  {
   "zh": "部位行的参照是不同仪器、不同人群的 CIELAB 均值，只用了部位之间的差；残差反映的是模型的血量变化给不出那么高的 a*，不是测量误差。",
   "en": "The regional rows use CIELAB means from other instruments and populations, and only the differences between sites; the residual reflects that the model's blood changes cannot reach that much a*, not a measurement error."
  }
 ],
